# EI-14414 (2026-07-19): the base ignore lines above (node_modules/, dist/, etc.) were
# missing from this submodule even though the WI-4419 block below was already added —
# git-sync auto-commits every submodule on a schedule, so any `npm install`/test run
# that creates node_modules/ here would get swept into this repo's history within
# minutes. See packages/operator-core/lib/harness/gitmodules-invariants.test.ts's
# "submodule .gitignore invariants" describe block for the recurrence guard.

# WI-4419 (2026-07-12): agent state dirs (.papercusp/) appear inside submodules too,
# and git-sync auto-commits the superproject AND every submodule — so any scratch a
# gitignore does not cover is committed automatically and then swept into every
# release bundle by the sidecar source-tar glob. The superproject .gitignore does NOT
# reach inside a submodule, so the guard must be repeated here. Depth-matching (**/)
# on purpose: a slash-bearing pattern is anchored to THIS file's directory.
.papercusp/scratch/
.papercusp/vitest-tmp/
.papercusp/tmp/
.papercusp/tmp-*/
.papercusp/logs/
.papercusp/bench-reports/
.papercusp/pi-sessions/
**/.papercusp/scratch/
**/.papercusp/vitest-tmp/
**/.papercusp/tmp/
**/.papercusp/tmp-*/
**/.papercusp/logs/
**/.papercusp/bench-reports/
**/.papercusp/pi-sessions/
